helpers. OpenMOSS does not endorse this independent project.

Source:
https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/52b87fca23acedc399d062d593bec388aee9926a/skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer/scripts/compile_prompt.py

The blind A/B evaluator references these OpenMOSS publisher models:
https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-Base
https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-SFT
The evaluator contains no model weights or publisher example images. Users
provide their own image pair locally; image bytes are not uploaded or exported.
